<title>SPAIN: Spain Banesto cuts prime rate to seven pct.</title>
<headline>Spain Banesto cuts prime rate to seven pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banesto said on Tuesday that it would lower its prime rate by 25 basis points to seven percent as of today.</p>
<p>This cut follows the Bank of Spain's decision to cut its key rate by 25 basis points to 5.50 percent.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
